  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthy community preventing alcohol/drugs, SGBV &amp; CR violations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new project, piloting integrated prevention of alcohol and drug use, gender-based violence and promotion of child rights. Children and youth in 5 selected communities will be join Child Clubs, taught life skills and become change makers; adults to be involved in Happy Family/Men Engage. Village committees initiate the work and merge into community prevention and rights CSOs. The synergies gained from integration of thematic areas will strengthen involvement and produce sustainable results.</narrative>
  </description>
